{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>We would appreciate your feedback and suggestions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/\u610f\u898b\u56de\u994b_GIF.gif?t=1740488551\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/Gemmy_Happy_GIF.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Simple but not easy! Move! Avoid the traps! Reach the goal!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/\u6383\u63cf\u6a5f_For_Steam.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0\u00a0<strong>How to Play:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use only your mouse to guide Gemmy across the map to the goal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not touch any traps, objects, or even the walls!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, the game becomes more challenging, testing not only your control skills but also your ability to strategize and find a way through the traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/\u6383\u63cf\u6a5f_For_Steam.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 types of traps, each with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through these traps, timing your movements carefully to avoid hazards\u2014some even challenge you to pass within a time limit or as the path rotates. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may even find yourself in shifting mazes where the walls constantly change position, making every second count!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps interact with each other, creating even more diverse and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/Gemmy_Well.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/Gemmy_Scare_GIF.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/extras/Gemmy_Dead_GIF.gif?t=1740488551\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udccc Accessible to players of any language, even though the system interface is currently available only in English.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steady your hands, move with precision, dodge the obstacles, and rush forward at the perfect moment!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460320?t=1740488551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740488551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/d344be97ca3832ae2d9ba2d015f135d8ba11cdb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740488551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460320/d344be97ca3832ae2d9ba2d015f135d8ba11cdb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740488551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3460350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>We would appreciate your feedback and suggestions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/